WEBVTT

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:33.110
Oori?

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:34.420
Brother...

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:36.590
You look confused.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:37.880
Yeah.

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:40.550
What are you doing here anyway?

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:43.980
Couldn't you get any sleep?

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:47.570
I can't sleep...

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:55.740
on such a pleasant night.

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:26.360
What was that?

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.210
Keisei's energy...

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:32.220
Maybe your connection has been broken?

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:37.410
I heard Shikabane Himes and Contracted Priests are connected.

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:39.650
If that's true, you should know...

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:43.130
that your Contracted Priest just died.

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:44.900
You're lying!

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:49.760
This bastard's body...

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:52.430
Now I'm gonna have some fun.

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:54.150
Just like the time you were human.

00:02:57.050 --> 00:03:00.910
So the priest was a Corpse himself.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.110
That could explain why the Shichisei were after him.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:08.710
All the rest of his followers who were employed there were murdered shortly after.

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:11.620
It's just like a chain of deaths.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:12.640
Bishop!

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.170
Big trouble!

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:15.470
Outside!

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:19.460
What's this?

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:21.200
It's a Jinchi.

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:24.560
It is one of the Corpses' curses.

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.750
It creates a space to surround its enemies.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:31.830
But a weak Jinchi like this couldn't possibly stop us from getting through.

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:35.350
The enemies probably just want to slow us down.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:38.020
Who they're really after is...

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:39.620
Tagami Shikei and Makina-chan!

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:46.840
Let's hear those shitty priests' cries.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:48.720
Shall we kill them after all?

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:54.920
So sorry, brother.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:58.280
I wanted to put you to rest in one shot but...

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:02.700
it's difficult to control a body you're not used to.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.690
You are one of the Shichisei.

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:07.080
But...

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:10.310
I'll end it with this.

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:14.460
Hey, hey.

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:16.920
Don't forget this is your little brother.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:18.520
I know that.

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:19.870
That is why...

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:25.090
I wont let you use Oori any longer!

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:26.280
Katsu!

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:28.950
This guy?!

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:29.720
Brother?

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:30.670
His energy?!

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:31.700
This is...

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:48.240
The living's energy can be really strong.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.500
Only thing left now is to enjoy the show.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:58.650
Brother?!

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:00.990
It seems like you've come to your senses.

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:03.480
That wound...

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:08.950
So that really wasn't a dream?

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:11.190
I stabbed...

00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:16.100
Being stabbed by a brat like you won't do me anything.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:19.500
At least as long as the souma works.

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:21.460
Shikei.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.490
You are too naive.

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:27.580
Oori!

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:28.680
Get out!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:29.540
Oori!

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:30.660
There.

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:31.300
Again.

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:45.820
Just like I said.

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:47.990
You are too naive.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:54.420
Geez!

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:56.830
This is so shady!

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:00.160
May I?

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.190
As you wish.

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:02.620
Show it to them.

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:05.340
Note: Tsurugi Hime means Sword princess
Show them why they call you the Tsurugi Hime.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:05.910
Yes.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:07.360
Bishop.

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:29.690
So this is the most powerful Shikabane Hime?

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:31.460
The Jinchi will break soon.

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:34.370
But we've saved enough time.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:45.640
You still have the power to resist?

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:49.210
That means your boyfriend isn't quite dead yet.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.840
But it's only a matter of time.

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:57.050
When that Contracted Priest dies you'll just be another Co—

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:07.970
You can't defeat me!

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:13.620
Because I don't have a body you can shred into pieces!

00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:18.080
I was granted this form when I became a Shichisei-member.

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:21.700
Now I can go wherever I want, and live on for eternity!

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:34.950
I forgot to mention something.

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:39.000
I can change this body's shape whenever I want.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:43.390
Sometimes I'm a gassy cloud, sometimes I'm an inflammable fluid.

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:50.730
What I've been longing for this whole time was to assassinate you all.

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:55.060
The attachment that made me a Corpse.

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:58.350
But that wasn't enough.

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:01.640
Is that attachment not enough?

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:08.910
Fool!

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:10.600
You ignited me again!

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:16.540
Keisei.

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:33.630
I finally got what I came for.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:38.060
The eye of a Contracted Priest filled with despair.

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:42.040
It's ten times more powerful than those of the dead.

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:47.740
Don't touch me with those hands.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:58.560
No.

00:08:59.130 --> 00:08:59.720
Keisei?

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:01.200
No!

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:04.590
Such immature words don't suit you.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:08.040
Don't forget that you are just a Corpse now.

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:12.240
Now I shall unveil that identify in front of Keisei's corpse.

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:14.720
Shikei?

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:15.860
Impossible!

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:18.720
Keisei?

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:21.220
So here you are?

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:23.300
Little girl!

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:25.460
Makina!

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:28.090
I'm going to blow you up!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:37.860
W-What's this?!

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:42.200
What?

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:43.980
What is this?

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:46.890
The Shikimi's poison has covered your whole body.

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:48.030
But...

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:51.440
If you bit that with your own mouth, you'll also—

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:53.520
You just won't shut up, will you?

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:54.140
Keisei.

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:55.350
Did you realize it?

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:59.430
You're within my range right now!

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:00.920
Open!

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:02.210
My Zadan!

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:06.890
This is a sutra?

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:12.490
This allows him to damage Corpses, but it also damages his own body.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:14.320
I see.

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.160
Those eyes!

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:16.590
Those are the eyes of a man who accepted death.

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:17.400
Keisei.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:19.280
What are you doing?

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:20.020
Keisei?

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.240
I'm losing my strength.

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:28.930
Shikei?!

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:31.030
Don't you want to live?!

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:32.170
Don't you want to know the truth?!

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:33.270
I don't need it!

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:34.100
Shikei!

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:39.750
I don't need a truth that would make me kill my own Shikabane Hime like you did!

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.540
I don't want to know it!

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:44.970
This is?!

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:54.700
Keisei?

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:57.130
Please, Keisei?

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:01.200
It's your fault.

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:03.490
It's all my fault.

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:04.520
I'm sorry.

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:05.640
Don't apologize!

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:07.420
Don't apologize.

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:10.960
I'll kill you if you apologize again.

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:16.220
What happened to Keisei isn't your fault.

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:20.320
He just protected his family and his beliefs.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.940
You certainly didn't make this happen!

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:27.040
It was never this world which I was attached to.

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:30.470
Oori, there is something I want to ask of you.

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:38.290
I want you to save Makina and the others in my place.

00:11:39.310 --> 00:11:41.290
What do you mean by that?

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:45.750
Do you mean you want to pass on the contract?

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:46.800
Yeah.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:53.060
I won't forgive you.

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:55.420
I can't forgive you for that.

00:11:56.660 --> 00:12:00.380
You are my one and only Contracted Priest.

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:02.930
I'm sorry, Makina.

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:05.220
I can't go on any longer.

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:08.340
You should know in which state I am now.

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:13.940
There's no time for me to explain my reasons to you either.

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:16.480
You may disagree with this.

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:19.160
But you know what happened to Minai, right?

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:26.000
Shikabane Hime who lose their Contracted Priest die or become a mere Corpse.

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:28.670
I don't want that to happen to Makina.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:31.440
I don't care about what happens to me!

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:34.110
I died once already.

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:35.490
Keisei.

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:40.210
I'll do it.

00:12:45.350 --> 00:12:46.180
Note: Shingon means new connection
Shingon.

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:52.100
I hope you two will understand.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:53.520
My existence will fade.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.220
Without any complaints or regrets.

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:59.270
I have come to accept and forgive.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:03.180
And I am ready to fade or be transformed into a new being.

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:10.690
Flesh!

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:13.140
I want that flesh!

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:15.550
Of all the Corpses you've captured!

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:18.030
I understand.

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:29.220
I'll kill everyone who opposes me!

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:34.020
The process will be completed when he wakes up.

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:37.290
Take Oori somewhere safe.

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:42.030
Not me.

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:42.980
Oori.

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:45.300
I'm taking you to a hospital.

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:46.840
I'll contact the Honzan.

00:13:47.390 --> 00:13:48.300
Makina.

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:49.850
I can't.

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:51.830
I can't do that.

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:56.430
I can't give up on your life, Keisei.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:59.910
Please, go to Oori.

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:01.290
No.

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:03.000
I don't want you to die, Keisei.

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:12.510
I'm sorry, Makina.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:16.180
I wasn't able to keep my promise.

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:18.570
Promise?

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:21.380
The one about me fighting with you together.

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:24.930
I don't care about such a promise anymore.

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:26.690
Please live.

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:28.510
Live, Keisei!

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:30.750
You don't have to fight anymore.

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:31.410
Live.

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:33.180
Thank you, Makina.

00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:37.040
The days we've fought together weren't bad.

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:38.920
It's been fun.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:42.320
So please, smile.

00:14:43.760 --> 00:14:45.810
I want to see your smiling face one last time.

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:47.210
Kei...

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:49.980
Please smile for me, Makina.

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:58.370
So I can tell myself I've saved you from this living hell.

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:05.460
If Keisei still longs for something or has an attachment to this world...

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:09.150
there is a chance he could become a Corpse.

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:11.690
If only a Corpse...

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:14.160
If he will continue living...

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:17.600
Keisei?

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:19.580
Look at me.

00:16:05.530 --> 00:16:06.560
Keisei?

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:11.580
We're going to Takami Shikei!

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:13.400
We're going on ahead.

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:16.730
Bishop?

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:30.150
Sadahiro?

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:31.910
Are you still awake?

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:33.250
We're going home.

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:37.280
But if Tagami Keisei finds out...

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:40.210
You don't have to worry about that.

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:43.110
Probably.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:51.430
Where are you?!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.990
That fucking dead Shikabane Hime!

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:57.180
Where is she?!

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:57.940
I'm here!

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:16.030
I'm going to erase...

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:17.870
All of you...

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:19.960
From my sight!

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:22.420
Don't exaggerate!

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.130
You're just a dead little girl!

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:31.350
Disappear!

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:33.430
From my sight...

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:35.600
From my memory...

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.170
From this world!

00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:39.700
Where's that strength coming from?

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:42.490
She's like a completely different person!

00:17:43.030 --> 00:17:43.800
It can't be!

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:46.700
Is that really Hoshimura-san?

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:48.090
Really?

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.470
This is a curse.

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:15.260
A curse that makes her stronger than a Shikabane Hime can really be.

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:18.880
She's cursing the Corpse.

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:20.310
But!

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:21.690
Hoshimura-san?

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:23.070
Ouch!

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:25.840
What's this?

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:27.960
My hands are burning.

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:30.030
It hurts.

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:47.880
Such fearful power.

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:49.340
But Shikei...

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:56.820
Your Shikabane Hime is extracting strength from her new Contracted Priest by draining his life.

00:18:57.540 --> 00:19:00.630
A child who has gotten no training at all, can't take that.

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:04.070
He will die.

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:06.900
Makina...

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:11.620
This is what you longed for.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:18.840
Let me go!

00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:21.580
You have a brain.

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:24.400
I'm just going to change your form.

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:25.750
Stop.

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:26.760
Stop it!

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:27.760
I...

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:29.190
I want to live.

00:19:29.190 --> 00:19:30.620
I don't care what shape I'll be.

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:32.020
I just want to live!

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:37.000
I'll return the exact same words you said to me two years ago.

00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:38.600
You're pitiful.

00:19:50.590 --> 00:19:53.140
What are you going to do with that boy?

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.930
We have an orphanage.

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:57.930
Are you going to raise him?

00:19:57.930 --> 00:19:59.500
I have no choice.

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:02.930
I want to see this boy smile.

00:20:29.530 --> 00:20:30.870
My attachment to this boy...

00:20:32.180 --> 00:20:34.880
This is the end.

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:02.800
The dawn has come.

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:06.860
During this long night...

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:08.760
The night I became sixteen...

00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:14.720
I lost the person who was my father, brother and friend...

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:18.920
And became a Contracted Priest.

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:28.240
Keisei's funeral you say?

00:23:28.350 --> 00:23:32.380
A funeral is just like a dinner party for Corpses.

00:23:33.090 --> 00:23:35.670
At this special farewell ceremony for Contracted Priests...

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:38.650
a new world unknown to you will be unveiled.
